<div class="content-box" style="background: #fff3cd; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;">
    <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i> Watch Out For</h2>
    <p>Common misconceptions to avoid:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>General AI: Believing that "Strong AI" (human-level across all domains) is currently available technology (Textbook Clarification: only Narrow AI is available).</li>
        <li>Data Objectivity: The belief that data is inherently neutral, ignoring that human bias is frequently encoded into training sets.</li>
    </ul>
